{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q00", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 27, "text": "关注 AI 积木师，带你从 AI 的视角解读和理解生活", "wall_s": 295.609, "audio_s": 6.66, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 44.386, "cold_load_s": 295.837, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.66s rms=0.1129", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q00_rep1.wav", "ts": "00:21:48"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q01", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 26, "text": "这是我用三十秒录音克隆出来的声音，现在由它来念这段话", "wall_s": 328.499, "audio_s": 8.74, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 37.586, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=8.74s rms=0.0953", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q01_rep1.wav", "ts": "00:27:17"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q02", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 22, "text": "今天是二零二六年十月二十七日，星期二，天气晴", "wall_s": 296.013, "audio_s": 7.91, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 37.423, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=7.91s rms=0.1013", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q02_rep1.wav", "ts": "00:32:13"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q03", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 19, "text": "没显卡的电脑也能跑语音合成，只是慢一点", "wall_s": 280.134, "audio_s": 6.43, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 43.567, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.43s rms=0.0879", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q03_rep1.wav", "ts": "00:36:53"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q04", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 19, "text": "一句话，一段录音，一个属于你自己的声音", "wall_s": 273.76, "audio_s": 5.94, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 46.088, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=5.94s rms=0.1078", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q04_rep1.wav", "ts": "00:41:27"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q05", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 19, "text": "这件衣服太重了，我们重新称一下它的重量", "wall_s": 280.469, "audio_s": 5.07, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 55.319, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=5.07s rms=0.1086", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q05_rep1.wav", "ts": "00:46:07"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q06", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 21, "text": "银行行长说，今年行业行情不错，值得重新评估", "wall_s": 288.378, "audio_s": 6.78, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 42.534, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.78s rms=0.1107", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q06_rep1.wav", "ts": "00:50:56"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q07", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 21, "text": "他喜欢音乐，更乐于助人，大家都说他活得快乐", "wall_s": 290.293, "audio_s": 6.83, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 42.503, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.83s rms=0.1005", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q07_rep1.wav", "ts": "00:55:46"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q08", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 19, "text": "这条裙子长度太长了，需要重新量一次尺寸", "wall_s": 280.795, "audio_s": 6.93, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 40.519, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.93s rms=0.0970", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q08_rep1.wav", "ts": "01:00:27"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q09", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 19, "text": "天气真差，差点迟到，估计差不多个把小时", "wall_s": 275.566, "audio_s": 6.95, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 39.65, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.95s rms=0.0846", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q09_rep1.wav", "ts": "01:05:02"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q10", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 69, "text": "如果你也想在自己的电脑上跑一个语音合成模型，第一步是准备一段干净的录音，第二步是选一个许可允许商用的开源引擎，第三步就是等它把文字念出来。", "wall_s": 600.581, "audio_s": 0.0, "sr": 0, "rtf": null, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": false, "note": "HTTP 503: {\"detail\":\"TTS generate ran for more than 600s of actual compute time and was abandoned — the backend is running, but this job was too heavy for the available compute. The abandoned job cannot be killed: it keeps running and keeps holding the device until it finishes on its own, so an immediate re", "path": null, "ts": "01:15:03"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q11", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 54, "text": "这段话一共四十多个字，主要用来观察它在长句当中的换气位置，以及说到最后几个字的时候，音色会不会和开头不一致。", "wall_s": 533.646, "audio_s": 17.56, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 30.39, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=17.56s rms=0.0940", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q11_rep1.wav", "ts": "01:23:57"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q12", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 42, "text": "早上一杯豆浆，中午一碗面条，晚上一碗白粥，这就是我这两天的全部食谱，简单，但很管饱。", "wall_s": 422.772, "audio_s": 14.39, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 29.38, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=14.39s rms=0.0858", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q12_rep1.wav", "ts": "01:30:59"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q13", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 49, "text": "他先是愣了一下，随后笑了笑，把桌上的文件整理好，转身对同事说，这个方案我们明天再讨论，今天太晚了。", "wall_s": 471.101, "audio_s": 17.28, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 27.263, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=17.28s rms=0.0722", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q13_rep1.wav", "ts": "01:38:50"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q14", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 49, "text": "从录音到合成，中间要经过参考音频编码、文本编码、声学预测、声码器解码这四个步骤，每一步都要花时间。", "wall_s": 472.9, "audio_s": 15.88, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 29.78, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=15.88s rms=0.1019", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q14_rep1.wav", "ts": "01:46:43"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q15", "rep": 1, "group": "4 数字与英文夹杂", "text_chars": 40, "text": "我用的是 Ryzen 7 5700G 处理器，内存三十二GB，硬盘剩五百三十GB", "wall_s": 364.232, "audio_s": 10.75, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 33.882, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=10.75s rms=0.0820", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q15_rep1.wav", "ts": "01:52:48"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q16", "rep": 1, "group": "4 数字与英文夹杂", "text_chars": 32, "text": "这段音频采样率是两万四千赫兹，时长大约十四秒，文件六百七十九KB", "wall_s": 364.769, "audio_s": 11.36, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 32.11, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=11.36s rms=0.0890", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q16_rep1.wav", "ts": "01:58:52"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q17", "rep": 1, "group": "4 数字与英文夹杂", "text_chars": 36, "text": "打开 Terminal，输入 pip install，回车，等它装完就行", "wall_s": 285.902, "audio_s": 7.45, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 38.376, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=7.45s rms=0.0854", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q17_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:03:38"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q18", "rep": 1, "group": "4 数字与英文夹杂", "text_chars": 24, "text": "二零二六年，第三季度，营收同比增长百分之十二点六", "wall_s": 310.495, "audio_s": 8.17, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 38.004, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=8.17s rms=0.0965", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q18_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:08:49"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q19", "rep": 1, "group": "4 数字与英文夹杂", "text_chars": 25, "text": "这个模型有零点六个B参数，量化之后大概二点三四GB", "wall_s": 311.892, "audio_s": 8.17, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 38.175, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=8.17s rms=0.0953", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q19_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:14:01"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q20", "rep": 1, "group": "5 语气与情感", "text_chars": 26, "text": "太好了，终于跑通了，我就知道这台老电脑还能再战几年。", "wall_s": 322.689, "audio_s": 9.21, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 35.037, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=9.21s rms=0.0754", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q20_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:19:23"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q21", "rep": 1, "group": "5 语气与情感", "text_chars": 19, "text": "唉，又失败了，第三遍了，还是那个报错。", "wall_s": 266.514, "audio_s": 5.38, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 49.538, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=5.38s rms=0.0875", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q21_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:23:50"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q22", "rep": 1, "group": "5 语气与情感", "text_chars": 20, "text": "你听一下这段，是不是有点像我自己的声音？", "wall_s": 283.101, "audio_s": 6.25, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 45.296, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.25s rms=0.1040", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q22_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:28:33"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q23", "rep": 1, "group": "5 语气与情感", "text_chars": 19, "text": "别急，慢慢来，这个参数改完应该就好了。", "wall_s": 271.635, "audio_s": 5.48, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 49.568, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=5.48s rms=0.0989", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q23_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:33:05"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice", "qid": "q24", "rep": 1, "group": "5 语气与情感", "text_chars": 18, "text": "行，就这么定了，明天开始跑正式测试。", "wall_s": 262.5, "audio_s": 5.29, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 49.622, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=5.29s rms=0.0915", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice\\q24_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:37:27"}
