{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q12", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 42, "text": "早上一杯豆浆，中午一碗面条，晚上一碗白粥，这就是我这两天的全部食谱，简单，但很管饱。", "wall_s": 109.606, "audio_s": 15.52, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 7.062, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=15.52s rms=0.1045", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q12_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:52:39"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q13", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 49, "text": "他先是愣了一下，随后笑了笑，把桌上的文件整理好，转身对同事说，这个方案我们明天再讨论，今天太晚了。", "wall_s": 100.175, "audio_s": 13.88, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 7.217, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=13.88s rms=0.1093", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q13_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:54:19"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q14", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 49, "text": "从录音到合成，中间要经过参考音频编码、文本编码、声学预测、声码器解码这四个步骤，每一步都要花时间。", "wall_s": 119.402, "audio_s": 16.96, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 7.04, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=16.96s rms=0.1034", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q14_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:56:19"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q15", "rep": 1, "group": "4 数字与英文夹杂", "text_chars": 40, "text": "我用的是 Ryzen 7 5700G 处理器，内存三十二GB，硬盘剩五百三十GB", "wall_s": 73.913, "audio_s": 9.96, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 7.421, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=9.96s rms=0.1306", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q15_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:57:33"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q16", "rep": 1, "group": "4 数字与英文夹杂", "text_chars": 32, "text": "这段音频采样率是两万四千赫兹，时长大约十四秒，文件六百七十九KB", "wall_s": 81.687, "audio_s": 11.28, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 7.242, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=11.28s rms=0.1070", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q16_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:58:54"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q17", "rep": 1, "group": "4 数字与英文夹杂", "text_chars": 36, "text": "打开 Terminal，输入 pip install，回车，等它装完就行", "wall_s": 62.185, "audio_s": 8.08, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 7.696, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=8.08s rms=0.1018", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q17_rep1.wav", "ts": "02:59:57"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q18", "rep": 1, "group": "4 数字与英文夹杂", "text_chars": 24, "text": "二零二六年，第三季度，营收同比增长百分之十二点六", "wall_s": 60.273, "audio_s": 7.76, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 7.767, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=7.76s rms=0.1135", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q18_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:00:57"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q19", "rep": 1, "group": "4 数字与英文夹杂", "text_chars": 25, "text": "这个模型有零点六个B参数，量化之后大概二点三四GB", "wall_s": 54.548, "audio_s": 6.8, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 8.022, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.80s rms=0.1278", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q19_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:01:51"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q20", "rep": 1, "group": "5 语气与情感", "text_chars": 26, "text": "太好了，终于跑通了，我就知道这台老电脑还能再战几年。", "wall_s": 51.409, "audio_s": 6.2, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 8.292, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.20s rms=0.1084", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q20_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:02:43"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q21", "rep": 1, "group": "5 语气与情感", "text_chars": 19, "text": "唉，又失败了，第三遍了，还是那个报错。", "wall_s": 57.232, "audio_s": 7.24, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 7.905, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=7.24s rms=0.0912", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q21_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:03:40"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q22", "rep": 1, "group": "5 语气与情感", "text_chars": 20, "text": "你听一下这段，是不是有点像我自己的声音？", "wall_s": 44.841, "audio_s": 5.16, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 8.69, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=5.16s rms=0.1267", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q22_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:04:25"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q23", "rep": 1, "group": "5 语气与情感", "text_chars": 19, "text": "别急，慢慢来，这个参数改完应该就好了。", "wall_s": 51.144, "audio_s": 6.28, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 8.144, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.28s rms=0.1091", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q23_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:05:16"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "cosyvoice", "qid": "q24", "rep": 1, "group": "5 语气与情感", "text_chars": 18, "text": "行，就这么定了，明天开始跑正式测试。", "wall_s": 45.007, "audio_s": 5.2, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 8.655, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=5.20s rms=0.1104", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\cosyvoice\\q24_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:06:01"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "voxcpm2", "qid": "q00", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 27, "text": "关注 AI 积木师，带你从 AI 的视角解读和理解生活", "wall_s": 267.531, "audio_s": 5.6, "sr": 48000, "rtf": 47.773, "cold_load_s": 267.54, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=48000 dur=5.60s rms=0.1272", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\voxcpm2\\q00_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:10:29"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "voxcpm2", "qid": "q01", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 26, "text": "这是我用三十秒录音克隆出来的声音，现在由它来念这段话", "wall_s": 191.738, "audio_s": 5.44, "sr": 48000, "rtf": 35.246, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=48000 dur=5.44s rms=0.1320", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\voxcpm2\\q01_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:13:40"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "voxcpm2", "qid": "q02", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 22, "text": "今天是二零二六年十月二十七日，星期二，天气晴", "wall_s": 191.024, "audio_s": 5.44, "sr": 48000, "rtf": 35.115, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=48000 dur=5.44s rms=0.1223", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\voxcpm2\\q02_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:16:52"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "voxcpm2", "qid": "q03", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 19, "text": "没显卡的电脑也能跑语音合成，只是慢一点", "wall_s": 171.168, "audio_s": 4.8, "sr": 48000, "rtf": 35.66, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=48000 dur=4.80s rms=0.1219", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\voxcpm2\\q03_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:19:43"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "voxcpm2", "qid": "q04", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 19, "text": "一句话，一段录音，一个属于你自己的声音", "wall_s": 165.945, "audio_s": 4.64, "sr": 48000, "rtf": 35.764, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=48000 dur=4.64s rms=0.1318", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\voxcpm2\\q04_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:22:29"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "voxcpm2", "qid": "q05", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 19, "text": "这件衣服太重了，我们重新称一下它的重量", "wall_s": 150.91, "audio_s": 4.16, "sr": 48000, "rtf": 36.277, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=48000 dur=4.16s rms=0.1312", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\voxcpm2\\q05_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:25:00"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "voxcpm2", "qid": "q06", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 21, "text": "银行行长说，今年行业行情不错，值得重新评估", "wall_s": 175.607, "audio_s": 4.96, "sr": 48000, "rtf": 35.405, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=48000 dur=4.96s rms=0.1372", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\voxcpm2\\q06_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:27:55"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "voxcpm2", "qid": "q07", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 21, "text": "他喜欢音乐，更乐于助人，大家都说他活得快乐", "wall_s": 156.396, "audio_s": 4.32, "sr": 48000, "rtf": 36.203, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=48000 dur=4.32s rms=0.1247", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\voxcpm2\\q07_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:30:32"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "voxcpm2", "qid": "q08", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 19, "text": "这条裙子长度太长了，需要重新量一次尺寸", "wall_s": 160.514, "audio_s": 4.48, "sr": 48000, "rtf": 35.829, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=48000 dur=4.48s rms=0.1128", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\voxcpm2\\q08_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:33:12"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "voxcpm2", "qid": "q09", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 19, "text": "天气真差，差点迟到，估计差不多个把小时", "wall_s": 181.142, "audio_s": 5.12, "sr": 48000, "rtf": 35.379, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=48000 dur=5.12s rms=0.1123", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\voxcpm2\\q09_rep1.wav", "ts": "03:36:13"}
