{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q00", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 27, "text": "关注 AI 积木师，带你从 AI 的视角解读和理解生活", "wall_s": 317.703, "audio_s": 6.9, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 46.044, "cold_load_s": 317.716, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.90s rms=0.0980", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice-subprocess\\q00_rep1.wav", "ts": "04:46:04"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q01", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 26, "text": "这是我用三十秒录音克隆出来的声音，现在由它来念这段话", "wall_s": 300.579, "audio_s": 0.0, "sr": 0, "rtf": null, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": false, "note": "HTTP 500: {\"detail\":\"Couldn't synthesize audio. See Settings → Logs → Backend for the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeError: TTS engine stopped mid-generation with an error VoiceStudio doesn't recognize. Retry once; if it keeps failing, please report it with the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeE", "path": null, "ts": "04:51:04"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q02", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 22, "text": "今天是二零二六年十月二十七日，星期二，天气晴", "wall_s": 316.495, "audio_s": 6.15, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 51.463, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.15s rms=0.1115", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice-subprocess\\q02_rep1.wav", "ts": "04:56:21"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q03", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 19, "text": "没显卡的电脑也能跑语音合成，只是慢一点", "wall_s": 280.859, "audio_s": 6.9, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 40.704, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.90s rms=0.0949", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice-subprocess\\q03_rep1.wav", "ts": "05:01:01"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q04", "rep": 1, "group": "1 基准短句", "text_chars": 19, "text": "一句话，一段录音，一个属于你自己的声音", "wall_s": 273.094, "audio_s": 5.58, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 48.942, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=5.58s rms=0.1157", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice-subprocess\\q04_rep1.wav", "ts": "05:05:35"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q05", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 19, "text": "这件衣服太重了，我们重新称一下它的重量", "wall_s": 279.927, "audio_s": 5.96, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 46.968, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=5.96s rms=0.0922", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice-subprocess\\q05_rep1.wav", "ts": "05:10:14"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q06", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 21, "text": "银行行长说，今年行业行情不错，值得重新评估", "wall_s": 287.533, "audio_s": 7.44, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 38.647, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=7.44s rms=0.1059", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice-subprocess\\q06_rep1.wav", "ts": "05:15:02"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q07", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 21, "text": "他喜欢音乐，更乐于助人，大家都说他活得快乐", "wall_s": 289.357, "audio_s": 6.46, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 44.792, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.46s rms=0.0936", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice-subprocess\\q07_rep1.wav", "ts": "05:19:51"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q08", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 19, "text": "这条裙子长度太长了，需要重新量一次尺寸", "wall_s": 279.891, "audio_s": 5.6, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 49.98, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=5.60s rms=0.1008", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice-subprocess\\q08_rep1.wav", "ts": "05:24:31"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q09", "rep": 1, "group": "2 多音字", "text_chars": 19, "text": "天气真差，差点迟到，估计差不多个把小时", "wall_s": 275.359, "audio_s": 6.24, "sr": 24000, "rtf": 44.128, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": true, "note": "OK sr=24000 dur=6.24s rms=0.0928", "path": "D:/study/ai-jms/voice_samples/ep25_run\\slot_0015\\audio\\omnivoice-subprocess\\q09_rep1.wav", "ts": "05:29:07"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q10", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 69, "text": "如果你也想在自己的电脑上跑一个语音合成模型，第一步是准备一段干净的录音，第二步是选一个许可允许商用的开源引擎，第三步就是等它把文字念出来。", "wall_s": 300.489, "audio_s": 0.0, "sr": 0, "rtf": null, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": false, "note": "HTTP 500: {\"detail\":\"Couldn't synthesize audio. See Settings → Logs → Backend for the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeError: TTS engine stopped mid-generation with an error VoiceStudio doesn't recognize. Retry once; if it keeps failing, please report it with the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeE", "path": null, "ts": "05:34:07"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q11", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 54, "text": "这段话一共四十多个字，主要用来观察它在长句当中的换气位置，以及说到最后几个字的时候，音色会不会和开头不一致。", "wall_s": 318.106, "audio_s": 0.0, "sr": 0, "rtf": null, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": false, "note": "HTTP 500: {\"detail\":\"Couldn't synthesize audio. See Settings → Logs → Backend for the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeError: TTS engine stopped mid-generation with an error VoiceStudio doesn't recognize. Retry once; if it keeps failing, please report it with the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeE", "path": null, "ts": "05:39:25"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q12", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 42, "text": "早上一杯豆浆，中午一碗面条，晚上一碗白粥，这就是我这两天的全部食谱，简单，但很管饱。", "wall_s": 316.573, "audio_s": 0.0, "sr": 0, "rtf": null, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": false, "note": "HTTP 500: {\"detail\":\"Couldn't synthesize audio. See Settings → Logs → Backend for the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeError: TTS engine stopped mid-generation with an error VoiceStudio doesn't recognize. Retry once; if it keeps failing, please report it with the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeE", "path": null, "ts": "05:44:42"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q13", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 49, "text": "他先是愣了一下，随后笑了笑，把桌上的文件整理好，转身对同事说，这个方案我们明天再讨论，今天太晚了。", "wall_s": 316.839, "audio_s": 0.0, "sr": 0, "rtf": null, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": false, "note": "HTTP 500: {\"detail\":\"Couldn't synthesize audio. See Settings → Logs → Backend for the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeError: TTS engine stopped mid-generation with an error VoiceStudio doesn't recognize. Retry once; if it keeps failing, please report it with the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeE", "path": null, "ts": "05:49:59"}
{"kind": "cell", "engine": "omnivoice-subprocess", "qid": "q14", "rep": 1, "group": "3 长句与停顿", "text_chars": 49, "text": "从录音到合成，中间要经过参考音频编码、文本编码、声学预测、声码器解码这四个步骤，每一步都要花时间。", "wall_s": 316.991, "audio_s": 0.0, "sr": 0, "rtf": null, "cold_load_s": null, "ok": false, "note": "HTTP 500: {\"detail\":\"Couldn't synthesize audio. See Settings → Logs → Backend for the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeError: TTS engine stopped mid-generation with an error VoiceStudio doesn't recognize. Retry once; if it keeps failing, please report it with the full trace. Underlying error: RuntimeE", "path": null, "ts": "05:55:16"}
